      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Module: aml-sub-shared\n\nRuns once per subscription\nafter subscription vending.\n\nCreates shared infrastructure\nused by all 25 product stamps\nin this subscription.\n\nACR: up to 500 repositories,\none Premium tier per sub.\n\nDNS: links to ALZ zones only\n(never creates zones).\n\nLA: routes all AML diagnostic\nlogs to central workspace.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Module: aml-sub-shared\n\nRuns once per subscription\nafter subscription vending.\n\nCreates shared infrastructure\nused by all 25 product stamps\nin this subscription.\n\nACR: up to 500 repositories,\none Premium tier per sub.\n\nDNS: links to ALZ zones only\n(never creates zones).\n\nLA: routes all AML diagnostic\nlogs to central workspace.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
